flowchart TB
    subgraph L1[Level 1: one call]
        direction LR
        a1[Question] --> a2[LLM] --> a3[Answer]
    end
    subgraph L2[Level 2: a workflow]
        direction LR
        b1[Step 1<br/>LLM] --> b2[Step 2<br/>plain code] --> b3[Step 3<br/>LLM]
    end
    subgraph L3[Level 3: an agent]
        direction LR
        c1[LLM decides] --> c2{Need a tool?}
        c2 -- yes --> c3[Use the tool]
        c3 --> c1
        c2 -- no --> c4[Final answer]
    end
    L1 ~~~ L2
    L2 ~~~ L3